abstract: >-
  Isolated lab comparing FSOT 2.1 outputs for the Navier-Stokes, BSD and Hodge
  problems against public data, with checks in Python, Rust, Z3, Coq, Isabelle
  and F*. Not a Clay Millennium Prize claim.
keywords: [fsot, navier-stokes, birch-swinnerton-dyer, hodge-conjecture, formal-verification]
